From a7971a982403c329fe4de790c776ecb1e285ae30 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 16:47:22 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] policy(v2): relay and accept legacy and v7 transactions

Delete the RPC refusal of non-v7 transactions (IsDisallowedNonV7Tx):
sendrawtransaction, the batch submission paths and testmempoolaccept now
admit legacy versions 1 and 2 under the consensus rules of the bridge.
Versions other than 1, 2 and 7 already fail to decode (bad-txns-version),
so the RPCs report "TX decode failed".

Tests:
- txvalidation_tests: a version 1 spend and a version 2 child enter the
  mempool; version 3 bytes do not decode.
- policy_fee_tests: the legacy P2PKH payment is allowed.
- mempool_accept: the oversize and policy tx-size cases use one large
  output (a legacy transaction now has the 256 input/output caps); a
  257-input legacy transaction gives bad-txns-v2-too-many-inputs; version
  3 gives TX decode failed.
- rpc_rawtransaction: versions 1 and 2 decode; 0, 3, 6, 8 and the 32-bit
  extremes do not.
- rpc_packages: the partially accepted package's child is made
  nonstandard by its output script instead of its version.
- feature_mdbx_crash and wallet_groups fund in transactions of at most
  250 outputs.
- lotus_v2_loopback_tps_stress expects bad-txns-legacy-spends-v2-coin.

Rebase onto coordinator 276 (81e8ef1774): policy_fee_tests runs on the
coordinator's NativeSnapshotChainSetup, which has no legacy coins, so it
mines one legacy coinbase to a fresh P2PKH key, matures it, and signs the
legacy payment with SignSignature.

Tier: V2

Coordinator integration provenance (network403):
Resolve integration context by retaining the incoming purposeful change together with existing shared/native consumers; exact old/new patch and file inventory is retained in owner-adaptations.json. No authored purpose or removed downstream behavior restored.
Original scripted commands/hashes above are original-author provenance; modified parent/tool/catalog hashes are not claimed to reproduce this composition. Exact coordinator adaptation scripts and ordered tree proof are in composed403-network-metrics-delivery. Build/runtime/benchmarks NOT_RUN for this composition under user compile-first policy.

Coordinator integration provenance (reference405):
0036-unspent-mdbx-crash-funding.patch: Same-purpose introduced defect; original named owner retained.
All60 authored input payloads retained, with prerequisite-aware same-purpose splits; distinct legacy-index and inherited CXX compatibility remain independent. Pre-format source equals exact403+all60 control tree95718fceff83364b74294a751bd752b2f1a4e384. Only pinnedRuff import/format cleanup follows. Original author commands/hashes are historical reference evidence, not combined405 approval. Reference OFF/native/Rust full gates are preserved separately; combined compile/runtime NOT_RUN.
